# macOS
.DS_Store
*.pem
# ...except this one. It is a PUBLIC root CA (Sectigo Public Server
# Authentication Root R46), not a key — the anchor Android's WebView is missing
# for Albertsons' identity host. The build cannot produce a working login
# without it, and its fingerprint is pinned in tests/unit/webviewTrustAnchors.
!assets/certs/*.pem

